$ factory work list -h
exit 0
--- stdout
usage: factory work list [flags]

List work items, highest priority first, then oldest first. When more
items match than --limit, the next page's cursor is printed on stderr.

Flags:
  --claimed-by ID
      only items claimed by this worker ID
  --cursor CURSOR
      the cursor of the page to list, printed by the page before it
  --limit INT
      at most this many items; the server's default is 50 and its most 200
  --output FORMAT
      output format: table or json (default table)
  --repo REPOSITORY
      only items that change this repository (owner/name)
  --server URL
      the factory server's URL, such as http://127.0.0.1:8080 (default
      $FACTORY_SERVER)
  --source SOURCE
      only items from this source, such as github
  --state STATE
      only items in this state: design, ready, in_progress, in_review,
      blocked, failed, completed, wont_fix

Environment:
  FACTORY_SERVER       the server's URL when --server is not given
  FACTORY_API_TOKEN    the API token the server was started with
--- stderr
